sociation":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Describe the bug\r\n\r\nAccording to https://docs.sqlalchemy.org/en/14/core/engines.html#sqlalchemy.create_engine.params.pool_size setting `pool_size` size 0 means that the pool is unlimited. I expected that `max_overflow` is ignored in such a case and the pool size will increase when necessary and never decrease. Hence, it will always be equal to the peak demand for connections.\r\n\r\nHowever, the following code hangs on the query which suggests `pool_size=0` means empty pool.\r\n\r\n### To Reproduce\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import create_engine\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import sessionmaker\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.pool import QueuePool\r\n\r\nengine = create_engine(\r\n    \"PG_URI\",\r\n    echo=True,\r\n    pool_size=0,\r\n    max_overflow=0,\r\n    poolclass=QueuePool,\r\n)\r\nSession = sessionmaker(bind=engine)\r\nsession = Session()\r\n\r\nsession.execute(\"SELECT 1\")\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n### Error\r\n\r\nThe code hangs.\r\n\r\n### Versions\r\n\r\n- OS: Ubuntu\r\n- Python: 3.10\r\n- SQLAlchemy: 1.4.41\r\n- Database: PostgreSQL 13\r\n- DBAPI: psycopg2\r\n\r\n\r\n### Additional context\r\n\r\nAs connections are created lazily, unlimited pool size can be emulated by setting `pool_size` to a huge number. Maybe it's just a documentation issue.","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/8523/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/8523/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}